gPct%&gt;%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/li&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;li class=&quot;status-row&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;span class=&quot;status-name zcs-font-14 zcs-color-secondary&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;status-dot&quot; style=&quot;background:#2A6FFC;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Approved&lt;/span&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;strong class=&quot;zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;%=approvedAwaiting%&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;zcs-color-tertiary zcs-font-normal&quot;&gt;(&lt;%=approvedPct%&gt;%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/li&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;li class=&quot;status-row&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;span class=&quot;status-name zcs-font-14 zcs-color-secondary&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;status-dot&quot; style=&quot;background:#F4660C;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Vehicle Assigned&lt;/span&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;strong class=&quot;zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;%=assignedTrips%&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;zcs-color-tertiary zcs-font-normal&quot;&gt;(&lt;%=assignedPct%&gt;%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/li&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;li class=&quot;status-row&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;span class=&quot;status-name zcs-font-14 zcs-color-secondary&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;status-dot&quot; style=&quot;background:#179E6C;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Completed&lt;/span&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;strong class=&quot;zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;%=completedTrips%&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;zcs-color-tertiary zcs-font-normal&quot;&gt;(&lt;%=completedPct%&gt;%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/li&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;li class=&quot;status-row&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;span class=&quot;status-name zcs-font-14 zcs-color-secondary&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;status-dot&quot; style=&quot;background:#FE455D;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Rejected&lt;/span&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;strong class=&quot;zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;%=rejectedRequests%&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;zcs-color-tertiary zcs-font-normal&quot;&gt;(&lt;%=rejectedPct%&gt;%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/li&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/ul&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\n\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-lg-12 zcs-col-md-12 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;transport-section-title&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;h3&gt;Quick Links&lt;/h3&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;Open the key reports for approvals, assignment, trips, vehicles, and drivers&lt;/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-16 zcs-p-24 zcs-box-border&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;quick-link-bar&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;a class=&quot;zcs-button zcs-primary-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body&quot; href=&quot;#Report:Pending_Transport_Approvals&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;i class=&quot;zcs-button-icon zc-li-outline ui-2-time&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-button-text&quot;&gt;Pending Approvals&lt;/span&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/a&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;a class=&quot;zcs-button zcs-primary-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body&quot; href=&quot;#Report:Approved_For_Assignment&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;i class=&quot;zcs-button-icon zc-li-outline ui-1-check-circle-08&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-button-text&quot;&gt;Approved For Assignment&lt;/span&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/a&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;a class=&quot;zcs-button zcs-primary-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body&quot; href=&quot;#Report:Assigned_Trips&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;i class=&quot;zcs-button-icon zc-li-outline arrows-1-tail-right&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-button-text&quot;&gt;Assigned Trips&lt;/span&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/a&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;a class=&quot;zcs-button zcs-primary-outline-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body&quot; href=&quot;#Report:Available_Vehicles&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;i class=&quot;zcs-button-icon zc-li-outline design-app&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-button-text&quot;&gt;Available Vehicles&lt;/span&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/a&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;a class=&quot;zcs-button zcs-primary-outline-button zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-rounded-md zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body&quot; href=&quot;#Report:Available_Drivers&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;i class=&quot;zcs-button-icon zc-li-outline ui-1-check-circle-08&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-button-text&quot;&gt;Available Drivers&lt;/span&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/a&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p class=&quot;zcs-font-13 zcs-color-tertiary zcs-m-0&quot;&gt;Dashboard counts are calculated at page load from Transport_Requests, Vehicles, and Drivers.&lt;/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t&lt;/section&gt;\n\n\t&lt;section class=&quot;transport-section&quot;&gt;\n\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;transport-section-title&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;h3&gt;Upcoming Trips&lt;/h3&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;Trips scheduled for the next 7 days, excluding rejected requests&lt;/p&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-badge zcs-badge-filled zcs-inline-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-rounded-sm zcs-px-10 zcs-py-2 zcs-box-border zcs-badge-theme&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-badge-text zcs-font-12 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body&quot;&gt;Next 7 days&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;\n\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-table-wrapper zcs-rounded-lg zcs-box-border zcs-relative&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;table class=&quot;zcs-w-full&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;thead class=&quot;zcs-sticky&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Request No.&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Department&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Travel Start&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Travel End&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Destination&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Vehicle&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Driver&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Status&lt;/th&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;/thead&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;%\n\tupcomingCount = 0;\n\tfor each trip in Transport_Requests[Travel_Start &gt;= zoho.currenttime &amp;&amp; Travel_Start &lt;= nextWeek &amp;&amp; Request_Status != &quot;Rejected&quot;] sort by Travel_Start asc\n\t{\n\t\tif(upcomingCount &lt; 10)\n\t\t{\n\t\t\tupcomingCount = upcomingCount + 1;\n\t\t\trequestNo = ifnull(trip.Request_Number,&quot;-&quot;);\n\t\t\tdepartmentName = &quot;-&quot;;\n\t\t\tif(trip.Department != null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tdepartmentName = trip.Department.Department_Name;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tstartText = &quot;-&quot;;\n\t\t\tif(trip.Travel_Start != null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tstartText = trip.Travel_Start.toString(&quot;dd-MMM-yyyy hh:mm a&quot;);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tendText = &quot;-&quot;;\n\t\t\tif(trip.Travel_End != null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tendText = trip.Travel_End.toString(&quot;dd-MMM-yyyy hh:mm a&quot;);\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tdestinationText = ifnull(trip.Destination,&quot;-&quot;);\n\t\t\tvehicleText = &quot;-&quot;;\n\t\t\tif(trip.Assigned_Vehicle != null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tvehicleText = trip.Assigned_Vehicle.Vehicle_Number;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tdriverText = &quot;-&quot;;\n\t\t\tif(trip.Assigned_Driver != null)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tdriverText = trip.Assigned_Driver.Driver_Name;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tstatusText = ifnull(trip.Request_Status,&quot;-&quot;);\n\t\t\tstatusClass = &quot;zcs-badge-theme&quot;;\n\t\t\tif(statusText == &quot;Pending&quot;)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tstatusClass = &quot;zcs-badge-yellow&quot;;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\telse if(statusText == &quot;Approved&quot;)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tstatusClass = &quot;zcs-badge-blue&quot;;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\telse if(statusText == &quot;Vehicle Assigned&quot;)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tstatusClass = &quot;zcs-badge-orange&quot;;\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\telse if(statusText == &quot;Completed&quot;)\n\t\t\t{\n\t\t\t\tstatusClass = &quot;zcs-badge-green&quot;;\n\t\t\t}\n%&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;tr&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;%=requestNo%&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;%=departmentName%&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;%=startText%&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;%=endText%&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;trip-destination&quot;&gt;&lt;%=destinationText%&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;%=vehicleText%&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;%=driverText%&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;td class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-badge zcs-badge-filled zcs-inline-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-gap-8 zcs-rounded-sm zcs-px-10 zcs-py-2 zcs-box-border &lt;%=statusClass%&gt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-badge-text zcs-font-12 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body&quot;&gt;&lt;%=statusText%&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;%\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\tif(upcomingCount == 0)\n\t{\n%&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;tr class=&quot;zcs-tnodata&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;td colspan=&quot;8&quot; class=&quot;no-data-row zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body&quot;&gt;No upcoming trips are scheduled for the next 7 days.&lt;/td&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/tr&gt;\n&lt;%\n\t}\n%&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;/tbody&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;/table&gt;\n\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t&lt;/section&gt;\n\n\t&lt;section class=&quot;transport-section&quot;&gt;\n\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-row zcs-gap-16&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-lg-12 zcs-col-md-12 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;transport-section-title&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;h3&gt;Fleet Availability&lt;/h3&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;Vehicle Availability_Status summary&lt;/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-row zcs-gap-16&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-12 zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border availability-card&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-label&quot;&gt;Available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-count&quot;&gt;&lt;%=vehicleAvailable%&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar zcs-rounded-sm&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar-indicator&quot; style=&quot;width:&lt;%=vehicleAvailablePct%&gt;%;background:#179E6C;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-12 zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border availability-card&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-label&quot;&gt;Assigned&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-count&quot;&gt;&lt;%=vehicleAssigned%&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar zcs-rounded-sm&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar-indicator&quot; style=&quot;width:&lt;%=vehicleAssignedPct%&gt;%;background:#F4660C;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-12 zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border availability-card&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-label&quot;&gt;Maintenance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-count&quot;&gt;&lt;%=vehicleMaintenance%&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar zcs-rounded-sm&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar-indicator&quot; style=&quot;width:&lt;%=vehicleMaintenancePct%&gt;%;background:#FAAE13;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-12 zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border availability-card&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-label&quot;&gt;Inactive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-count&quot;&gt;&lt;%=vehicleInactive%&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar zcs-rounded-sm&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar-indicator&quot; style=&quot;width:&lt;%=vehicleInactivePct%&gt;%;background:#FE455D;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\n\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-lg-12 zcs-col-md-12 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;transport-section-title&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;h3&gt;Driver Availability&lt;/h3&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&lt;p&gt;Driver Availability_Status summary&lt;/p&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-row zcs-gap-16&quot;&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-12 zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border availability-card&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-label&quot;&gt;Available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-count&quot;&gt;&lt;%=driverAvailable%&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar zcs-rounded-sm&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar-indicator&quot; style=&quot;width:&lt;%=driverAvailablePct%&gt;%;background:#179E6C;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-12 zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border availability-card&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-label&quot;&gt;Assigned&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-count&quot;&gt;&lt;%=driverAssigned%&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar zcs-rounded-sm&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar-indicator&quot; style=&quot;width:&lt;%=driverAssignedPct%&gt;%;background:#F4660C;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-12 zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border availability-card&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-label&quot;&gt;On Leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-count&quot;&gt;&lt;%=driverOnLeave%&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar zcs-rounded-sm&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar-indicator&quot; style=&quot;width:&lt;%=driverOnLeavePct%&gt;%;background:#FAAE13;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-col-6 zcs-col-sm-12 zcs-col-xs-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-card zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-12 zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border availability-card&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-label&quot;&gt;Inactive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;availability-count&quot;&gt;&lt;%=driverInactive%&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar zcs-rounded-sm&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-progress-bar-indicator&quot; style=&quot;width:&lt;%=driverInactivePct%&gt;%;background:#FE455D;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t&lt;/div&gt;\n\t&lt;/section&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t &lt;%}%&gt;\n\t\t\t\t ]]>\n\t\t\t\t</dsp>\n\t\t\t</column>\n\t\t</row>\n\t</layout>\n</zml>"
		}
	}

	workflow
	{
		form
		{
			Academic_Years_On_Validate as "Validate Academic Year Dates"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Academic_Years
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on validate
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.End_Date < input.Start_Date)
			                {
			                    alert "End Date cannot be before Start Date.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Attendance_On_Load as "Prepare Attendance Form"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Attendance
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on load
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Attendance_Date == null)
			                {
			                    input.Attendance_Date = zoho.currentdate;
			                }
			                if(input.Class == null)
			                {
			                    clear Student;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Attendance_On_Validate as "Validate Attendance"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Attendance
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on validate
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Attendance_Date > zoho.currentdate)
			                {
			                    alert "Attendance Date cannot be in the future.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                selectedStudent = Students[ID == input.Student];
			                if(selectedStudent.count() > 0 && selectedStudent.Class != input.Class)
			                {
			                    alert "Selected Student does not belong to the selected Class.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                duplicateAttendance = Attendance[Student == input.Student && Attendance_Date == input.Attendance_Date && Session == input.Session && ID != input.ID];
			                if(duplicateAttendance.count() > 0)
			                {
			                    alert "Attendance already exists for this Student, Date and Session.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Class_On_User_Input as "Filter Students By Class"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Attendance
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on user input of Class
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                clear Student;
			                input.Student = null;
			                if(input.Class != null)
			                {
			                    for each activeStudent in Students[Class == input.Class && Enrollment_Status == "Active"] sort by Admission_Number
			                    {
			                        Student:ui.add(activeStudent.ID);
			                    }
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Class_Subjects_On_Validate as "Validate Class Subject Mapping"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Class_Subjects
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on validate
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Weekly_Periods != null && input.Weekly_Periods <= 0)
			                {
			                    alert "Weekly Periods must be greater than zero.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if(input.Status == "Active")
			                {
			                    duplicateMappings = Class_Subjects[Academic_Year == input.Academic_Year && Class == input.Class && Subject == input.Subject && Status == "Active" && ID != input.ID];
			                    if(duplicateMappings.count() > 0)
			                    {
			                        alert "An active mapping already exists for this Academic Year, Class and Subject.";
			                        cancel submit;
			                    }
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Classes_On_Validate as "Validate Class Details"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Classes
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on validate
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Capacity != null && input.Capacity <= 0)
			                {
			                    alert "Capacity must be greater than zero.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Exams_On_Validate as "Validate Exam Details"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Exams
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on validate
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Max_Marks <= 0)
			                {
			                    alert "Max Marks must be greater than zero.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if(input.Pass_Marks < 0)
			                {
			                    alert "Pass Marks cannot be negative.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if(input.Pass_Marks > input.Max_Marks)
			                {
			                    alert "Pass Marks cannot exceed Max Marks.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                selectedYear = Academic_Years[ID == input.Academic_Year];
			                if(selectedYear.count() > 0)
			                {
			                    if(input.Exam_Date < selectedYear.Start_Date || input.Exam_Date > selectedYear.End_Date)
			                    {
			                        alert "Exam Date must fall within the selected Academic Year.";
			                        cancel submit;
			                    }
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Lesson_Plans_On_Load as "Prepare Lesson Plan Form"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Lesson_Plans
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on load
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Plan_Status == "Completed")
			                {
			                    show Completion_Date;
			                }
			                else
			                {
			                    hide Completion_Date;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Lesson_Plans_On_Validate as "Validate Lesson Plan"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Lesson_Plans
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on validate
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Plan_Status == "Completed" && input.Completion_Date == null)
			                {
			                    alert "Completion Date is required when the lesson plan is Completed.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if(input.Completion_Date != null && input.Completion_Date < input.Plan_Date)
			                {
			                    alert "Completion Date cannot be before Plan Date.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if(input.Plan_Date < zoho.currentdate.subDay(365))
			                {
			                    alert "Plan Date cannot be more than 365 days in the past.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Plan_Status_On_User_Input as "Toggle Completion Date"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Lesson_Plans
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on user input of Plan_Status
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Plan_Status == "Completed")
			                {
			                    show Completion_Date;
			                }
			                else
			                {
			                    input.Completion_Date = null;
			                    hide Completion_Date;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Marks_On_Load as "Prepare Marks Form"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Marks
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on load
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                disable Percentage;
			                disable Grade;
			                disable Result;
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Marks_On_Validate as "Validate Marks"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Marks
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on validate
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                selectedExam = Exams[ID == input.Exam];
			                selectedStudent = Students[ID == input.Student];
			                if(selectedExam.count() > 0)
			                {
			                    if(input.Marks_Obtained < 0)
			                    {
			                        alert "Marks Obtained cannot be negative.";
			                        cancel submit;
			                    }
			                    if(input.Marks_Obtained > selectedExam.Max_Marks)
			                    {
			                        alert "Marks Obtained cannot exceed the exam Max Marks.";
			                        cancel submit;
			                    }
			                    if(selectedStudent.count() > 0 && selectedStudent.Class != selectedExam.Class)
			                    {
			                        alert "Selected Student does not belong to the Exam Class.";
			                        cancel submit;
			                    }
			                    duplicateMarks = Marks[Exam == input.Exam && Student == input.Student && ID != input.ID];
			                    if(duplicateMarks.count() > 0)
			                    {
			                        alert "Marks already exist for this Exam and Student.";
			                        cancel submit;
			                    }
			                    input.Percentage = ((input.Marks_Obtained / selectedExam.Max_Marks) * 100).round(2);
			                    if(input.Marks_Obtained >= selectedExam.Pass_Marks)
			                    {
			                        input.Result = "Pass";
			                    }
			                    else
			                    {
			                        input.Result = "Fail";
			                    }
			                    if(input.Percentage >= 90)
			                    {
			                        input.Grade = "A+";
			                    }
			                    else if(input.Percentage >= 80)
			                    {
			                        input.Grade = "A";
			                    }
			                    else if(input.Percentage >= 70)
			                    {
			                        input.Grade = "B";
			                    }
			                    else if(input.Percentage >= 60)
			                    {
			                        input.Grade = "C";
			                    }
			                    else if(input.Percentage >= 50)
			                    {
			                        input.Grade = "D";
			                    }
			                    else if(input.Percentage >= 40)
			                    {
			                        input.Grade = "E";
			                    }
			                    else
			                    {
			                        input.Grade = "F";
			                    }
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Staff_On_Validate as "Validate Staff Details"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Staff
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on validate
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Joining_Date != null && input.Joining_Date > zoho.currentdate)
			                {
			                    alert "Joining Date cannot be in the future.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Students_On_Validate as "Validate Student Details"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Students
			    record event = on add or edit
			
			    on validate
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Date_of_Birth > zoho.currentdate)
			                {
			                    alert "Date of Birth cannot be in the future.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if(input.Admission_Date < input.Date_of_Birth)
			                {
			                    alert "Admission Date cannot be before Date of Birth.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Driver_Acknowledgement_On_User_Input as "Driver Acknowledgement On User Input"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Transport_Requests
			    record event = on add or edit
			    description = "Guides drivers when acknowledging or declining an assigned trip."
			
			    on user input of Driver_Acknowledgement
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Driver_Acknowledgement == "Unable To Serve")
			                {
			                    alert "Please enter Driver Remarks explaining why you are unable to serve this trip.";
			                }
			                else if(input.Driver_Acknowledgement == "Acknowledged")
			                {
			                    alert "Trip acknowledged. Add Driver Remarks if the transport team needs any note.";
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Transport_Requests_On_Load as "Transport Requests On Load"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Transport_Requests
			    record event = on add or edit
			    description = "Prefills request details and adjusts browser field visibility by profile."
			
			    on load
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Request_DateTime == null)
			                {
			                    input.Request_DateTime = zoho.currenttime;
			                }
			                if(input.Request_Status == null || input.Request_Status == "")
			                {
			                    input.Request_Status = "Pending";
			                }
			                if(input.Driver_Acknowledgement == null || input.Driver_Acknowledgement == "")
			                {
			                    input.Driver_Acknowledgement = "Pending";
			                }
			                loggedInStaff = Staff_Directory[Email == zoho.loginuserid && Active_Status == "Active"];
			                if(input.Requester_Email == null || input.Requester_Email == "")
			                {
			                    input.Requester_Email = zoho.loginuserid;
			                }
			                if(loggedInStaff.count() > 0)
			                {
			                    input.Requester = loggedInStaff.ID;
			                    input.Department = loggedInStaff.Department;
			                    input.Requester_Email = loggedInStaff.Email;
			                }
			                hide Approval_Notification_Sent;
			                hide Rejection_Notification_Sent;
			                hide Assignment_Notification_Sent;
			                hide Completion_Notification_Sent;
			                if(thisapp.permissions.isUserInProfile("Staff"))
			                {
			                    hide Approval_and_Assignment;
			                    hide Driver_and_Completion;
			                    disable Request_Status;
			                    disable Request_DateTime;
			                }
			                else if(thisapp.permissions.isUserInProfile("Transport_Manager"))
			                {
			                    show Approval_and_Assignment;
			                    show Driver_and_Completion;
			                    disable Request_DateTime;
			                }
			                else if(thisapp.permissions.isUserInProfile("Driver"))
			                {
			                    hide Approval_and_Assignment;
			                    show Driver_and_Completion;
			                    disable Request_DateTime;
			                    disable Request_Status;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Transport_Requests_On_Success as "Transport Requests On Success"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Transport_Requests
			    record event = on add or edit
			    description = "Sends lifecycle notifications and updates driver/vehicle availability after request changes."
			
			    on success
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                approverRecipients = List();
			                approvers = Transport_Team[Active_Status == "Active" && Can_Approve == true];
			                for each approver in approvers
			                {
			                    if(approver.Email != null && approver.Email != "")
			                    {
			                        approverRecipients.add(approver.Email);
			                    }
			                }
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Pending" && approverRecipients.size() > 0)
			                {
			                    sendmail
			                    [
			                        from: zoho.adminuserid
			                        to: approverRecipients
			                        subject: "New Transport Request #" + input.Request_Number
			                        message: "A new transport request has been submitted for " + input.Destination + " from " + input.Travel_Start + " to " + input.Travel_End + ". Please review it in Pending Transport Approvals."
			                    ]
			                }
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Approved" && input.Approval_Notification_Sent != true && input.Requester_Email != null && input.Requester_Email != "")
			                {
			                    sendmail
			                    [
			                        from: zoho.adminuserid
			                        to: input.Requester_Email
			                        subject: "Transport Request Approved #" + input.Request_Number
			                        message: "Your transport request has been approved. Remarks: " + input.Manager_Remarks
			                    ]
			                    input.Approval_Notification_Sent = true;
			                }
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Rejected" && input.Rejection_Notification_Sent != true && input.Requester_Email != null && input.Requester_Email != "")
			                {
			                    sendmail
			                    [
			                        from: zoho.adminuserid
			                        to: input.Requester_Email
			                        subject: "Transport Request Rejected #" + input.Request_Number
			                        message: "Your transport request has been rejected. Remarks: " + input.Manager_Remarks
			                    ]
			                    input.Rejection_Notification_Sent = true;
			                }
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Vehicle Assigned" && input.Assignment_Notification_Sent != true)
			                {
			                    driverRecipients = List();
			                    if(input.Requester_Email != null && input.Requester_Email != "")
			                    {
			                        driverRecipients.add(input.Requester_Email);
			                    }
			                    if(input.Assigned_Driver != null)
			                    {
			                        driverRecord = Drivers[ID == input.Assigned_Driver];
			                        if(driverRecord.count() > 0 && driverRecord.Driver_Email != null && driverRecord.Driver_Email != "")
			                        {
			                            driverRecipients.add(driverRecord.Driver_Email);
			                            driverRecord.Availability_Status = "Assigned";
			                        }
			                    }
			                    if(input.Assigned_Vehicle != null)
			                    {
			                        vehicleRecord = Vehicles[ID == input.Assigned_Vehicle];
			                        if(vehicleRecord.count() > 0)
			                        {
			                            vehicleRecord.Availability_Status = "Assigned";
			                        }
			                    }
			                    if(driverRecipients.size() > 0)
			                    {
			                        sendmail
			                        [
			                            from: zoho.adminuserid
			                            to: driverRecipients
			                            subject: "Vehicle Assigned for Transport Request #" + input.Request_Number
			                            message: "Vehicle and driver have been assigned for the trip to " + input.Destination + ". Assignment remarks: " + input.Assignment_Remarks
			                        ]
			                    }
			                    input.Assignment_Notification_Sent = true;
			                }
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Completed" && input.Completion_Notification_Sent != true)
			                {
			                    completionRecipients = List();
			                    if(input.Requester_Email != null && input.Requester_Email != "")
			                    {
			                        completionRecipients.add(input.Requester_Email);
			                    }
			                    for each approverMail in approverRecipients
			                    {
			                        completionRecipients.add(approverMail);
			                    }
			                    if(input.Assigned_Driver != null)
			                    {
			                        completedDriver = Drivers[ID == input.Assigned_Driver];
			                        if(completedDriver.count() > 0)
			                        {
			                            completedDriver.Availability_Status = "Available";
			                        }
			                    }
			                    if(input.Assigned_Vehicle != null)
			                    {
			                        completedVehicle = Vehicles[ID == input.Assigned_Vehicle];
			                        if(completedVehicle.count() > 0)
			                        {
			                            completedVehicle.Availability_Status = "Available";
			                        }
			                    }
			                    if(completionRecipients.size() > 0)
			                    {
			                        sendmail
			                        [
			                            from: zoho.adminuserid
			                            to: completionRecipients
			                            subject: "Transport Request Completed #" + input.Request_Number
			                            message: "The transport request for " + input.Destination + " has been completed. Completion remarks: " + input.Completion_Remarks
			                        ]
			                    }
			                    input.Completion_Notification_Sent = true;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Transport_Requests_On_Validate as "Transport Requests On Validate"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Transport_Requests
			    record event = on add or edit
			    description = "Validates trip timing, passenger count, lifecycle requirements, capacity, and assignment conflicts."
			
			    on validate
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Requester_Email == null || input.Requester_Email == "")
			                {
			                    alert "Requester Email is required.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if(input.Passenger_Count != null && input.Passenger_Count <= 0)
			                {
			                    alert "Passenger Count must be greater than zero.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if(input.Travel_Start != null && input.Travel_End != null && input.Travel_End <= input.Travel_Start)
			                {
			                    alert "Travel End must be after Travel Start.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if((input.Request_Status == "Approved" || input.Request_Status == "Rejected") && (input.Manager_Remarks == null || input.Manager_Remarks == ""))
			                {
			                    alert "Manager Remarks are required before approving or rejecting a request.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Vehicle Assigned")
			                {
			                    if(input.Assigned_Vehicle == null || input.Assigned_Driver == null)
			                    {
			                        alert "Assigned Vehicle and Assigned Driver are required before moving to Vehicle Assigned.";
			                        cancel submit;
			                    }
			                    if(input.Assigned_Vehicle != null)
			                    {
			                        selectedVehicle = Vehicles[ID == input.Assigned_Vehicle];
			                        if(selectedVehicle.count() > 0)
			                        {
			                            if(selectedVehicle.Active_Status != "Active")
			                            {
			                                alert "Selected vehicle is not active.";
			                                cancel submit;
			                            }
			                            if(selectedVehicle.Availability_Status != "Available")
			                            {
			                                currentVehicleAssignment = Transport_Requests[ID == input.ID && Assigned_Vehicle == input.Assigned_Vehicle && Request_Status == "Vehicle Assigned"];
			                                if(currentVehicleAssignment.count() == 0)
			                                {
			                                    alert "Selected vehicle is not available.";
			                                    cancel submit;
			                                }
			                            }
			                            if(selectedVehicle.Seating_Capacity < input.Passenger_Count)
			                            {
			                                alert "Selected vehicle does not have enough seating capacity.";
			                                cancel submit;
			                            }
			                        }
			                    }
			                    if(input.Assigned_Driver != null)
			                    {
			                        selectedDriver = Drivers[ID == input.Assigned_Driver];
			                        if(selectedDriver.count() > 0)
			                        {
			                            if(selectedDriver.Active_Status != "Active")
			                            {
			                                alert "Selected driver is not active.";
			                                cancel submit;
			                            }
			                            if(selectedDriver.Availability_Status != "Available")
			                            {
			                                currentDriverAssignment = Transport_Requests[ID == input.ID && Assigned_Driver == input.Assigned_Driver && Request_Status == "Vehicle Assigned"];
			                                if(currentDriverAssignment.count() == 0)
			                                {
			                                    alert "Selected driver is not available.";
			                                    cancel submit;
			                                }
			                            }
			                        }
			                    }
			                    vehicleConflicts = Transport_Requests[ID != input.ID && Assigned_Vehicle == input.Assigned_Vehicle && Request_Status != "Completed" && Request_Status != "Rejected" && Travel_Start < input.Travel_End && Travel_End > input.Travel_Start];
			                    if(vehicleConflicts.count() > 0)
			                    {
			                        alert "Selected vehicle has another active booking in this travel window.";
			                        cancel submit;
			                    }
			                    driverConflicts = Transport_Requests[ID != input.ID && Assigned_Driver == input.Assigned_Driver && Request_Status != "Completed" && Request_Status != "Rejected" && Travel_Start < input.Travel_End && Travel_End > input.Travel_Start];
			                    if(driverConflicts.count() > 0)
			                    {
			                        alert "Selected driver has another active booking in this travel window.";
			                        cancel submit;
			                    }
			                }
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Completed" && (input.Completion_Remarks == null || input.Completion_Remarks == ""))
			                {
			                    alert "Completion Remarks are required before marking the trip completed.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			                if(input.Driver_Acknowledgement == "Unable To Serve" && (input.Driver_Remarks == null || input.Driver_Remarks == ""))
			                {
			                    alert "Driver Remarks are required when the driver is unable to serve.";
			                    cancel submit;
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Travel_End_On_User_Input as "Travel End On User Input"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Transport_Requests
			    record event = on add or edit
			    description = "Warns users when the travel end is invalid."
			
			    on user input of Travel_End
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Travel_Start != null && input.Travel_End != null && input.Travel_End <= input.Travel_Start)
			                {
			                    alert "Travel end must be after travel start.";
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Travel_Start_On_User_Input as "Travel Start On User Input"
			{
			    type = form
			    form = Transport_Requests
			    record event = on add or edit
			    description = "Warns users when the travel start is invalid."
			
			    on user input of Travel_Start
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            custom deluge script
			            (
			                if(input.Travel_Start != null && input.Travel_Start < zoho.currenttime)
			                {
			                    alert "Travel start should not be in the past.";
			                }
			                if(input.Travel_Start != null && input.Travel_End != null && input.Travel_Start >= input.Travel_End)
			                {
			                    alert "Travel start must be before travel end.";
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}
		}

		functions
		{
			Approve_Request as "Approve Request"
			{
			    type = functions
			    form = Transport_Requests
			    execution type = for each record
			    description = "Approves a pending transport request from the approvals report."
			
			    on start
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            on click
			            (
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Pending")
			                {
			                    input.Request_Status = "Approved";
			                    input.Approved_By_Email = zoho.loginuserid;
			                    input.Approval_DateTime = zoho.currenttime;
			                    if(input.Manager_Remarks == null || input.Manager_Remarks == "")
			                    {
			                        input.Manager_Remarks = "Approved by transport manager.";
			                    }
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Assign_Vehicle_Driver as "Assign Vehicle & Driver"
			{
			    type = functions
			    form = Transport_Requests
			    execution type = for each record
			    description = "Moves an approved request to Vehicle Assigned when vehicle and driver details are valid."
			
			    on start
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            on click
			            (
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Approved" && input.Assigned_Vehicle != null && input.Assigned_Driver != null)
			                {
			                    vehicleRecord = Vehicles[ID == input.Assigned_Vehicle];
			                    driverRecord = Drivers[ID == input.Assigned_Driver];
			                    if(vehicleRecord.count() > 0 && driverRecord.count() > 0 && vehicleRecord.Active_Status == "Active" && driverRecord.Active_Status == "Active" && vehicleRecord.Availability_Status == "Available" && driverRecord.Availability_Status == "Available" && vehicleRecord.Seating_Capacity >= input.Passenger_Count)
			                    {
			                        input.Request_Status = "Vehicle Assigned";
			                        input.Assignment_DateTime = zoho.currenttime;
			                        if(input.Assignment_Remarks == null || input.Assignment_Remarks == "")
			                        {
			                            input.Assignment_Remarks = "Vehicle and driver assigned by transport team.";
			                        }
			                    }
			                    else
			                    {
			                        info "Vehicle/driver must be active, available, and capacity must cover passenger count.";
			                    }
			                }
			                else
			                {
			                    info "Please edit the request to select Assigned Vehicle and Assigned Driver before running this action.";
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Mark_Completed as "Mark Completed"
			{
			    type = functions
			    form = Transport_Requests
			    execution type = for each record
			    description = "Marks an assigned trip as completed from transport manager or driver reports."
			
			    on start
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            on click
			            (
			                isTransportManager = thisapp.permissions.isUserInProfile("Transport_Manager");
			                isAssignedDriver = false;
			                if(input.Assigned_Driver != null)
			                {
			                    driverRecord = Drivers[ID == input.Assigned_Driver];
			                    if(driverRecord.count() > 0 && driverRecord.Driver_Email == zoho.loginuserid)
			                    {
			                        isAssignedDriver = true;
			                    }
			                }
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Vehicle Assigned" && (isTransportManager == true || isAssignedDriver == true))
			                {
			                    input.Request_Status = "Completed";
			                    input.Completed_By_Email = zoho.loginuserid;
			                    input.Completed_DateTime = zoho.currenttime;
			                    if(input.Completion_Remarks == null || input.Completion_Remarks == "")
			                    {
			                        input.Completion_Remarks = "Trip completed.";
			                    }
			                }
			                else
			                {
			                    info "Only the assigned driver or transport manager can complete an assigned trip.";
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}

			Reject_Request as "Reject Request"
			{
			    type = functions
			    form = Transport_Requests
			    execution type = for each record
			    description = "Rejects a pending transport request from the approvals report."
			
			    on start
			    {
			        actions
			        {
			            on click
			            (
			                if(input.Request_Status == "Pending")
			                {
			                    input.Request_Status = "Rejected";
			                    input.Approved_By_Email = zoho.loginuserid;
			                    input.Approval_DateTime = zoho.currenttime;
			                    if(input.Manager_Remarks == null || input.Manager_Remarks == "")
			                    {
			                        input.Manager_Remarks = "Rejected by transport manager.";
			                    }
			                }
			            )
			        }
			    }
			}
		}
	}

